  "text": "TreVeyon Henderson ran behind 2025 UDFA Corey Kiner in terms of carries (4 to 3) last night.\n\nOver the past 3 weeks, he's averaging less than 5 rush attempts per game and is running 6 routes per game, per @FantasyPtsData.\n\nHis 4.7 PPR expected fantasy points per game in this time would be just 59th among RBs on the season, and his full season mark isn't much better (5.8 XFP/G, 51st among RBs). \n\nFirmly in backup/handcuff territory, and shaping up to be one of the worst picks in fantasy drafts this offseason in round 6.",
